WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.320 --> 00:11.440
Wait, where are you going?

3
00:11.480 --> 00:12.320
I'm just trying to tuck you in.

4
00:16.280 --> 00:17.600
Come visit again when you're free.

5
00:17.640 --> 00:18.720
Grandpa, I'm not leaving soon.

6
00:18.720 --> 00:19.560
Who was talking to you?

7
00:19.720 --> 00:20.440
Grandpa...

8
00:20.880 --> 00:22.000
Just who is your actual grandson here?

9
00:22.400 --> 00:23.160
Hey.

10
00:23.560 --> 00:24.560
Want to try dating?

11
00:25.360 --> 00:26.800
Whether I like women or not,

12
00:26.960 --> 00:28.440
there's no way we could be together.

13
00:30.720 --> 00:32.680
I've endured this for long enough.

14
00:56.080 --> 00:56.840
P'Ing.

15
00:57.080 --> 00:58.800
I've put up with you for long enough,

16
00:59.200 --> 01:00.520
and that's only because of Itt.

17
01:00.960 --> 01:02.520
If you keep acting like this,

18
01:03.800 --> 01:05.600
I'll make you regret it for the rest of your life.

19
01:06.160 --> 01:07.320
Oh...

20
01:07.840 --> 01:08.960
How terrifying.

21
01:09.960 --> 01:12.000
Weren't you into it with me last night?

22
01:12.520 --> 01:14.039
Now you're acting all disgusted.

23
01:14.080 --> 01:14.800
Why...

24
01:17.120 --> 01:18.960
If you hadn't forced yourself on me,

25
01:19.160 --> 01:20.320
I never would've done that.

26
01:20.960 --> 01:22.760
If you weren't Itt's brother,

27
01:23.160 --> 01:24.680
I would have punched you a long time ago.

28
01:25.080 --> 01:25.880
Really?

29
01:26.920 --> 01:29.000
You think I'm scared?

30
01:33.520 --> 01:34.360
I get it now.

31
01:34.520 --> 01:36.360
You like it rough, don't you?

32
01:36.400 --> 01:38.360
Fine. Give me some time to do some research.

33
01:46.160 --> 01:47.120
Hold on.

34
01:48.600 --> 01:49.560
To be honest,

35
01:49.560 --> 01:51.039
I've never done it in the office before.

36
01:51.080 --> 01:52.080
Care to give it a try?

37
02:01.680 --> 02:02.400
Dammit.

38
02:03.400 --> 02:04.360
Still want to fight?

39
02:04.680 --> 02:05.840
I can do this all day.

40
02:09.880 --> 02:10.759
Good boy.

41
02:10.800 --> 02:12.520
How do you know I've never done it here?

42
02:16.240 --> 02:17.920
Get those filthy thoughts out of your head.

43
02:17.960 --> 02:19.760
Oh, my head is full of them.

44
02:20.600 --> 02:22.960
Why? Do you prefer being on top?

45
02:23.000 --> 02:24.520
I've got plenty of other positions.

46
02:24.520 --> 02:25.760
On your side or face down...

47
02:25.800 --> 02:27.840
Whatever you want, I can make it happen.

48
02:27.920 --> 02:30.440
Listen to yourself. Do you have no shame?

49
02:30.600 --> 02:31.400
That's my business.

50
02:31.400 --> 02:32.360
I can do whatever I want.

51
02:32.880 --> 02:34.400
Stop me if you can.

52
02:34.680 --> 02:35.440
Ow.

53
02:40.040 --> 02:42.120
You've got a lot of strength, you jerk.

54
02:45.480 --> 02:47.680
You're so damn shameless.

55
02:48.400 --> 02:49.120
Why?

56
02:49.160 --> 02:50.720
What's wrong with me?

57
02:50.760 --> 02:53.120
My looks, my body, my education, or my status?

58
02:53.320 --> 02:54.480
I'm great in bed, too.

59
02:54.520 --> 02:56.240
I just proved it to you last night, didn't I?

60
02:57.079 --> 02:58.680
You came a little too fast, though.

61
02:58.680 --> 03:00.520
Want me to help you work on that?

62
03:00.760 --> 03:01.560
Go to hell.

63
03:04.360 --> 03:05.120
Who is it?

64
03:05.520 --> 03:07.480
It's me, Itt.

65
03:10.200 --> 03:11.000
What is it?

66
03:11.640 --> 03:12.520
Is Yok in there?

67
03:12.560 --> 03:13.840
I just wanted to ask

68
03:13.840 --> 03:15.520
if he'd like to have lunch with me.

69
03:15.640 --> 03:17.760
We're busy with work. Go on ahead.

70
03:18.920 --> 03:20.680
Should I buy some for you?

71
03:20.680 --> 03:22.160
From that place P'Ing said was good.

72
03:22.760 --> 03:23.520
Sure.

73
03:25.040 --> 03:26.680
What about you, P'Ing?

74
03:27.120 --> 03:27.960
Don't bother.

75
03:28.560 --> 03:29.680
I'll find something myself.

76
03:29.920 --> 03:31.440
P'Ing, can I come in?

77
03:34.960 --> 03:35.760
P'Ing?

78
03:36.880 --> 03:37.880
What did I tell you?

79
03:39.440 --> 03:40.800
Don't make me say it again.

80
03:41.440 --> 03:43.440
Itt, go ahead and have lunch.

81
03:55.720 --> 03:57.520
When you talk to Itt,

82
03:57.680 --> 03:59.680
why do you have to be so gentle?

83
04:00.600 --> 04:01.960
Because Itt isn't like you.

84
04:02.840 --> 04:03.680
What are you going to do?

85
04:04.760 --> 04:05.840
What about you?

86
04:06.840 --> 04:07.760
Want another round?

87
04:10.880 --> 04:12.160
Go fix your hair in the other room

88
04:12.200 --> 04:13.760
and iron your clothes.

89
04:22.640 --> 04:24.400
Where did he get all that strength?

90
05:33.960 --> 05:34.760
Hey.

91
05:35.720 --> 05:36.840
What's taking you so long?

92
05:37.280 --> 05:38.760
This isn't a hotel, you know.

93
05:40.520 --> 05:41.320
Hey.

94
05:48.080 --> 05:49.200
I need to talk to you.

95
05:59.920 --> 06:02.560
I'll admit, I was partly to blame for what happened.

96
06:04.040 --> 06:06.000
But at the end of the day, it's because...

97
06:06.120 --> 06:07.640
you're just too narrow-minded, isn't it?

98
06:09.720 --> 06:12.000
Alright, regardless of who's right or wrong,

99
06:12.840 --> 06:14.120
from now on,

100
06:14.720 --> 06:16.440
I won't force you into anything anymore, okay?

101
06:16.800 --> 06:18.120
Let's have a fresh start.

102
06:18.800 --> 06:19.760
We'll be nothing

103
06:19.760 --> 06:21.040
more than a boss and an intern.

104
06:21.080 --> 06:22.280
You just focus on your internship,

105
06:22.320 --> 06:23.680
and I'll focus on mentoring you.

106
06:24.400 --> 06:25.160
Is that okay?

107
06:30.120 --> 06:31.160
What now?

108
06:33.240 --> 06:34.040
That's good.

109
06:35.640 --> 06:37.400
If that's all, put on your shirt and get out.

110
06:55.480 --> 06:56.640
He's so damn serious.

111
09:09.000 --> 09:09.680
Come in.

112
09:13.040 --> 09:14.280
P'Ing, it's me.

113
09:15.200 --> 09:15.960
Yeah.

114
09:16.560 --> 09:17.560
What is it?

115
09:25.400 --> 09:27.880
Are you and Yok okay?

116
09:35.000 --> 09:35.920
Why wouldn't we be?

117
09:36.600 --> 09:37.960
I just gave him an earful.

118
09:38.480 --> 09:40.360
He won't dare mess up his work again.

119
09:41.600 --> 09:42.200
I see.

120
09:43.400 --> 09:45.280
Secretary Piang just called me.

121
09:45.880 --> 09:47.640
Yok's brother's people got in touch

122
09:47.640 --> 09:48.960
regarding the land in Pattaya.

123
09:49.600 --> 09:50.520
They said...

124
09:50.760 --> 09:53.720
we can visit the site next month.

125
09:54.040 --> 09:54.840
Oh, really?

126
09:55.440 --> 09:58.040
Alright. At least there's some good news.

127
10:00.080 --> 10:01.480
Are you going to Pattaya?

128
10:05.240 --> 10:08.080
Of course. This is a major project.

129
10:08.720 --> 10:10.480
I've gotta check out the land myself.

130
10:12.440 --> 10:13.680
Can I come along?

131
10:14.040 --> 10:14.920
What for?

132
10:15.880 --> 10:17.040
We're not going on vacation.

133
10:17.040 --> 10:18.320
It's enough with just me and Yok.

134
10:22.080 --> 10:24.480
But I want to learn about this project, too.

135
10:27.960 --> 10:29.000
Please, P'Ing.

136
10:31.440 --> 10:32.720
Maybe next time.

137
10:35.320 --> 10:36.640
Grab me the ashtray.

138
10:37.160 --> 10:37.880
Okay.

139
10:43.720 --> 10:44.560
Put it right here.

140
10:46.800 --> 10:47.600
Okay.

141
10:48.360 --> 10:49.120
You can go now.

142
10:53.840 --> 10:54.720
P'Ing...

143
10:55.800 --> 10:57.160
I don't know

144
10:57.160 --> 10:58.960
what you and Yok were fighting about,

145
10:59.160 --> 11:01.880
but please don't be too hard on him.

146
11:07.280 --> 11:08.600
You sure know a lot, huh?

147
11:12.280 --> 11:13.080
Fine.

148
11:15.280 --> 11:16.800
You can come to Pattaya with us

149
11:17.480 --> 11:18.680
so Yok will have a friend around.

150
11:19.360 --> 11:20.480
Really, P'Ing?

151
11:21.000 --> 11:22.280
You're the best.

152
11:24.880 --> 11:26.040
You look a bit tired, though.

153
11:26.360 --> 11:27.560
Let me give you a massage.

154
11:28.960 --> 11:29.760
No...

155
11:31.560 --> 11:32.720
No need.

156
11:34.600 --> 11:35.800
I'm not tired. Go.

157
11:35.800 --> 11:37.440
I'm going back to work. Leave now.

158
11:37.720 --> 11:38.600
Okay.

159
11:39.960 --> 11:41.240
See you, then.

160
11:41.280 --> 11:42.320
Yeah, just go.

161
11:50.960 --> 11:51.880
That was hard.

162
11:54.840 --> 11:56.280
It hurt, you little brat.

163
12:14.080 --> 12:14.880
What is this?

164
12:15.680 --> 12:17.920
This room is cramped and smells musty.

165
12:19.240 --> 12:20.320
Open the window.

166
12:20.360 --> 12:21.080
Okay.

167
12:26.720 --> 12:29.600
This is the hotel P'Phet arranged for us.

168
12:31.000 --> 12:32.680
If it's not up to your standards,

169
12:32.840 --> 12:36.080
feel free to book a five-star hotel at your own expense.

170
12:36.360 --> 12:37.680
Actually, this room isn't bad.

171
12:37.720 --> 12:38.800
Don't you think so, Itt?

172
12:39.080 --> 12:40.720
The view is nice, too.

173
12:41.040 --> 12:41.840
It's perfectly fine.

174
12:42.840 --> 12:44.080
Just bear with it, P'Ing.

175
12:44.080 --> 12:45.640
But if you really can't stand it,

176
12:45.640 --> 12:46.840
Don't say another word.

177
12:46.920 --> 12:48.560
Since Mr. Phet booked this hotel for us,

178
12:48.600 --> 12:49.640
it's bound to be good.

179
12:50.800 --> 12:53.360
One night won't hurt.

180
12:54.280 --> 12:55.160
Mr. Ing,

181
12:55.960 --> 12:57.960
P'Phet has invited us for a meal tomorrow.

182
12:57.960 --> 12:59.560
For today, we'll have to eat the hotel buffet.

183
12:59.720 --> 13:00.640
Are you okay with that?

184
13:00.880 --> 13:01.840
I'm not.

185
13:02.360 --> 13:03.040
Since we're here,

186
13:03.080 --> 13:04.520
I want something more local.

187
13:05.160 --> 13:07.720
I'll order some seafood for you, then.

188
13:09.160 --> 13:11.000
Actually, I'm not even that hungry yet.

189
13:13.800 --> 13:15.800
Never mind. I'm not really hungry.

190
13:15.840 --> 13:17.160
I'll go for a walk on the beach.

191
13:17.160 --> 13:18.160
May I come along?

192
13:19.400 --> 13:20.120
Sure.

193
13:20.400 --> 13:21.840
You know this city better than I do.

194
13:22.520 --> 13:23.200
Right.

195
13:24.760 --> 13:25.400
Let's go.

196
13:26.080 --> 13:26.640
Come on.

197
13:41.080 --> 13:42.400
The view is incredible.

198
13:45.960 --> 13:46.640
It's beautiful.

199
13:46.680 --> 13:47.360
Yeah.

200
13:47.840 --> 13:49.720
Give it a try. It's so good.

201
13:58.160 --> 13:59.560
P'Ing, why don't you have a seat?

202
14:06.720 --> 14:07.640
Watch out.

203
14:14.880 --> 14:15.600
Yok,

204
14:16.720 --> 14:18.160
do you think there are any sharks?

205
14:20.160 --> 14:21.800
I'm sleepy. I'll get some shut-eye.

206
14:25.440 --> 14:26.640
I bet there's one.

207
14:29.200 --> 14:30.520
You're shark bait for sure.

208
14:32.680 --> 14:33.840
-Want to jump in? -Hey.

209
14:35.200 --> 14:36.320
How's the internship going?

210
14:37.320 --> 14:38.200
It's okay.

211
14:39.840 --> 14:40.600
How about boxing?

212
14:41.760 --> 14:42.800
Same as always.

213
14:43.280 --> 14:44.160
I've got it under control.

214
14:45.720 --> 14:46.720
That's good to hear.

215
15:28.600 --> 15:29.720
I like you.

216
15:29.960 --> 15:31.480
-But I'm not like that. -I know.

217
15:31.560 --> 15:33.120
Whether I like women or not,

218
15:33.960 --> 15:35.520
there's no way we could be together.

219
16:46.720 --> 16:47.520
P'Ing...

220
17:13.319 --> 17:14.079
Itt...

221
17:20.119 --> 17:21.200
Go away.

222
17:32.560 --> 17:33.200
Itt...

223
17:33.800 --> 17:34.440
Itt...

224
17:34.760 --> 17:35.640
Wait.

225
17:54.560 --> 17:55.560
What the hell?

226
17:57.560 --> 17:58.680
Itt, wait for me.

227
18:06.120 --> 18:07.200
Itt, hey.

228
18:07.360 --> 18:08.080
Itt...

229
18:09.000 --> 18:10.000
What are you doing?

230
18:10.680 --> 18:12.080
It's not what you think.

231
18:12.800 --> 18:13.840
What do you think I'm thinking?

232
18:15.480 --> 18:17.080
I don't feel anything for P'Ing.

233
18:18.600 --> 18:20.120
I know I have no right to say this,

234
18:20.720 --> 18:22.080
but if you want to date P'Ing,

235
18:22.080 --> 18:22.800
I just want to warn you

236
18:22.800 --> 18:23.720
that he never loves anyone.

237
18:23.720 --> 18:24.840
I'm afraid you'll get hurt.

238
18:25.480 --> 18:27.600
Itt, I seriously don't like P'Ing.

239
18:28.320 --> 18:29.120
I actually like...

240
18:29.160 --> 18:30.160
That's enough.

241
18:34.680 --> 18:35.720
I don't want to hear it.

242
18:36.000 --> 18:37.120
You should leave.

243
18:37.800 --> 18:39.040
I need some time alone.

244
18:41.040 --> 18:41.760
Itt...

245
19:15.120 --> 19:15.960
P'Ing...

246
19:20.080 --> 19:20.800
Itt...

247
20:09.320 --> 20:11.040
I was planning to talk to him

248
20:11.040 --> 20:12.800
about wanting to intern at Araya Group

249
20:12.800 --> 20:14.480
so I can work hard and prove myself.

250
20:14.520 --> 20:15.840
Maybe he'll start to see me in a better light.

251
20:16.560 --> 20:18.200
Put Itt

252
20:18.200 --> 20:19.800
in Corporate Development.

253
20:19.800 --> 20:21.680
As for Yok, stay here in this office.

254
20:21.840 --> 20:23.360
You'll be my personal assistant.

255
20:23.400 --> 20:24.160
Yok,

256
20:24.160 --> 20:25.480
what's going on between you and P'Ing?

257
20:25.520 --> 20:26.520
Nothing's going on.

258
20:32.640 --> 20:33.320
Itt...

259
20:49.040 --> 20:50.680
Excuse me, stop right there.

260
20:51.840 --> 20:53.040
I need to check your pocket.

261
20:53.320 --> 20:54.400
It looks like you took something

262
20:54.440 --> 20:55.840
but haven't paid for it yet.

263
20:56.520 --> 20:57.320
I didn't take it.

264
20:57.960 --> 21:00.680
If you didn't take it, then just let me search you.

265
21:01.200 --> 21:02.520
Or do you want me to call the police?

266
21:02.720 --> 21:03.640
Show me your pocket.

267
21:05.360 --> 21:06.160
Hey.

268
21:08.320 --> 21:09.080
Seeing that he's alone,

269
21:09.080 --> 21:10.320
you're acting all tough, huh?

270
21:12.040 --> 21:13.520
What right do you have to search him?

271
21:14.240 --> 21:15.160
Are you a cop?

272
21:17.280 --> 21:18.800
If something's missing, check the cameras.

273
21:21.880 --> 21:24.080
-The cameras happen to be broken. -Oh...

274
21:25.080 --> 21:26.440
Then you have no evidence.

275
21:27.800 --> 21:29.080
Accusing someone like this...

276
21:30.080 --> 21:31.600
If the police actually come,

277
21:33.040 --> 21:34.400
you will be in trouble.

278
21:37.720 --> 21:39.280
Filing a false report can land you in jail.

279
22:19.240 --> 22:20.280
Looking for this?

280
22:23.440 --> 22:24.200
What do you want?

281
22:33.000 --> 22:34.000
Don't be so mean.

282
22:43.560 --> 22:44.280
You want it?

283
22:46.600 --> 22:47.480
Why did you help me?

284
22:50.000 --> 22:52.120
I used to steal candy just like you.

285
22:56.080 --> 22:57.000
Is it really possible...

286
22:58.200 --> 22:59.800
to be so hungry that you're forced to steal?

287
23:11.360 --> 23:12.640
My parents died young,

288
23:14.400 --> 23:15.600
so I had to go live with relatives.

289
23:16.200 --> 23:17.640
Every time I had a meal,

290
23:19.320 --> 23:20.320
I didn't dare eat much.

291
23:20.680 --> 23:21.640
I didn't want to be a burden.

292
23:24.800 --> 23:25.880
Sometimes...

293
23:26.720 --> 23:28.520
I was so hungry I'd bite my nails off to eat.

294
23:32.280 --> 23:33.320
But in the end,

295
23:34.880 --> 23:36.520
no one really wanted to take me in.

296
23:37.680 --> 23:39.360
Still, I never blamed them.

297
23:41.320 --> 23:43.200
It wasn't their job to look after me, after all.

298
23:46.360 --> 23:47.600
But a kid's gotta grow.

299
23:49.240 --> 23:50.840
When I couldn't stand the hunger,

300
23:52.440 --> 23:54.400
I'd sneak out and steal something to eat.

301
23:56.960 --> 23:57.800
What about you?

302
23:59.560 --> 24:00.840
Is something stressing you out?

303
24:09.080 --> 24:10.240
My parents are still around.

304
24:11.960 --> 24:13.120
My family isn't struggling.

305
24:15.720 --> 24:16.560
Seriously?

306
24:18.560 --> 24:19.920
That makes my life so miserable.

307
24:26.040 --> 24:26.960
But there's this one person...

308
24:29.240 --> 24:30.280
who's so talented.

309
24:31.600 --> 24:34.680
He's someone I could never catch up to,

310
24:37.040 --> 24:37.960
but he...

311
24:39.640 --> 24:40.760
absolutely hates my guts.

312
25:28.640 --> 25:29.360
Who is it?

313
25:30.400 --> 25:31.200
It's me.

314
25:31.400 --> 25:32.200
Who?

315
25:32.800 --> 25:33.680
It's me.

316
25:46.440 --> 25:48.080
Wait, what the hell is wrong with you?

317
25:50.160 --> 25:51.560
What's gotten into you?

318
25:51.560 --> 25:53.080
What did you mean by what you said that day?

319
25:53.600 --> 25:54.240
Tell me.

320
25:55.160 --> 25:56.720
You said we'd only talk about work.

321
25:56.920 --> 25:58.440
What was all that at the beach today?

322
25:58.800 --> 25:59.600
Oh...

323
26:00.920 --> 26:01.520
Why?

324
26:01.560 --> 26:03.160
You just believe everything I say?

325
26:03.320 --> 26:06.520
Whoa, I didn't know the heir to the Sukonsiri family

326
26:06.560 --> 26:08.560
was this stupid. You're so damn easy to trick.

327
26:09.040 --> 26:10.240
Let me tell you something.

328
26:10.480 --> 26:11.680
When I want something,

329
26:12.080 --> 26:14.160
I'll make sure I get it.

330
26:15.280 --> 26:17.600
Fine, I'll make you get over me.

331
26:18.800 --> 26:20.120
Is that so? How?

332
26:20.160 --> 26:20.800
Show me.

333
26:20.800 --> 26:22.560
Can someone like you really pull it off?

334
26:31.120 --> 26:31.880
I see.

335
26:32.320 --> 26:34.520
Violence is how you solve problems, huh?

336
26:45.320 --> 26:46.120
Yok.

337
26:51.280 --> 26:52.600
Do you have no shame at all?

338
26:54.000 --> 26:55.920
Hey, stop acting so innocent.

339
26:55.920 --> 26:56.680
To be honest,

340
26:56.720 --> 26:57.680
the fact that I'm even into you

341
26:57.680 --> 26:59.120
is the best thing that's ever happened to you.

342
26:59.160 --> 27:00.320
Mark my words.

343
27:01.000 --> 27:03.080
If I don't get to have you at least once,

344
27:03.080 --> 27:04.640
I'll gladly stay beneath you forever.

345
27:15.080 --> 27:16.480
Are you sure you can pull that off?

346
27:16.480 --> 27:17.200
Why?

347
27:17.200 --> 27:18.800
You think I can't pull it off?

348
27:19.080 --> 27:20.200
Try me. Take off your pants

349
27:20.240 --> 27:21.880
and let me have you just once.

350
27:22.440 --> 27:24.320
I'm telling you...

351
27:25.320 --> 27:26.720
The first time, you might like it.

352
27:27.160 --> 27:28.320
But by the second time,

353
27:28.840 --> 27:30.480
you won't be able to get me out of your head.

354
27:33.960 --> 27:34.600
Hey...

355
27:34.600 --> 27:36.680
Dammit, can you take it easy?

356
27:44.960 --> 27:45.760
Well, well.

357
27:47.240 --> 27:48.600
Look how worked up you are.

358
27:48.600 --> 27:49.840
Just from a little touch,

359
27:49.880 --> 27:51.080
and your little guy is already waking up?

360
27:51.960 --> 27:54.080
Acting all cool like you don't like it.

361
27:55.240 --> 27:56.800
P'Ing, stop it now.

362
27:57.280 --> 27:58.520
Oh, you want me to stop?

363
27:58.560 --> 27:59.800
Fine. Then let me go

364
27:59.840 --> 28:01.600
and arch your back so I can have you.

365
28:01.640 --> 28:02.360
P'Ing,

366
28:02.400 --> 28:03.680
if you don't shut your mouth,

367
28:03.840 --> 28:05.680
I'll make you regret it for the rest of your life.

368
28:05.920 --> 28:07.160
You think I'm scared?

369
28:07.200 --> 28:08.480
Go for it.

370
28:08.920 --> 28:10.320
You wouldn't have the guts.

371
28:13.760 --> 28:14.920
You asked for this.

372
28:16.680 --> 28:17.320
Yok...

373
28:18.080 --> 28:20.080
Wait, why are you tying me up?

374
28:23.440 --> 28:26.000
Yok, untie me this instant.

375
28:27.480 --> 28:28.760
Where are you going?

376
28:32.520 --> 28:34.560
Hey, get back here and untie me.

377
28:38.680 --> 28:39.320
Yok...

378
28:39.840 --> 28:41.080
What do you think you're doing?

379
28:41.560 --> 28:42.680
I've never been a bottom.

380
28:45.680 --> 28:46.480
So what?

381
28:48.280 --> 28:49.400
Tonight, you'll find out

382
28:49.440 --> 28:50.680
who's meant to be the bottom.

383
29:01.200 --> 29:02.320
Yok, you...

384
29:09.400 --> 29:10.280
Yok,

385
29:10.680 --> 29:11.560
you son of a...

386
29:21.160 --> 29:22.600
Still got a smart mouth?

387
29:24.160 --> 29:26.320
Is that all you've got? You're pathetic.

388
29:32.640 --> 29:34.920
You're the only one who wants me on the bottom.

389
29:35.280 --> 29:37.880
I'd only ever let you do that to me.

390
30:28.240 --> 30:29.080
Yok...

391
30:42.080 --> 30:43.680
What did you mean by what you said that day?

392
30:45.880 --> 30:46.680
Yok...

393
31:02.800 --> 31:03.560
Come in.

394
31:12.160 --> 31:14.280
The fact that you didn't run away last night

395
31:14.400 --> 31:16.000
shows that you have a shred of decency.

396
31:18.880 --> 31:19.960
I brought you some medicine.

397
31:23.040 --> 31:23.760
Why?

398
31:25.120 --> 31:25.960
Feeling guilty?

399
31:26.440 --> 31:27.960
Is that why you brought me this medicine?

400
31:29.600 --> 31:30.600
Dammit.

401
31:32.920 --> 31:33.800
What are you doing?

402
31:35.200 --> 31:37.440
I should be asking what you are doing.

403
31:38.160 --> 31:38.800
Why?

404
31:39.560 --> 31:40.160
Sleeping with me

405
31:40.200 --> 31:42.160
is that embarrassing to you?

406
31:43.920 --> 31:45.160
Don't touch me.

407
31:45.760 --> 31:46.920
You should just...

408
31:47.440 --> 31:48.360
go to hell.

409
31:54.840 --> 31:56.200
If you're in pain, just take the medicine.

410
31:57.320 --> 31:58.680
I think you're the one...

411
31:58.920 --> 32:00.880
who needs a heavy dose of conscience.

412
32:02.360 --> 32:04.520
It's not like I'm pretending nothing happened.

413
32:04.560 --> 32:06.080
-We were both drunk last night. -Oh...

414
32:06.080 --> 32:07.080
It was just an accident.

415
32:07.080 --> 32:08.800
We were drunk? No, you were drunk.

416
32:10.080 --> 32:11.040
Let me ask you something.

417
32:11.560 --> 32:13.440
If you have even an ounce of manhood in you,

418
32:13.440 --> 32:14.720
start using your brain.

419
32:15.200 --> 32:16.040
Don't you remember

420
32:16.040 --> 32:17.000
when you were on top of me,

421
32:17.000 --> 32:18.040
moaning,

422
32:18.080 --> 32:18.840
your whole body turned pink

423
32:18.840 --> 32:20.480
like a damn pink Teletubby?

424
32:20.520 --> 32:21.800
Do you remember that?

425
32:22.600 --> 32:24.360
I turned you down so many times,

426
32:24.560 --> 32:26.200
but you wouldn't leave me alone.

427
32:26.240 --> 32:28.800
Turned me down? I didn't leave you alone?

428
32:28.800 --> 32:30.440
You didn't leave me alone. Look at these marks.

429
32:30.800 --> 32:32.040
You tied my arms up with a rope

430
32:32.040 --> 32:32.840
and took me.

431
32:32.840 --> 32:33.760
You did this, didn't you?

432
32:34.480 --> 32:36.040
You broke your promise first, didn't you?

433
32:39.240 --> 32:39.920
Okay.

434
32:40.720 --> 32:41.800
I just lost my temper.

435
32:42.320 --> 32:43.640
I'll take responsibility for what I did.

436
32:44.200 --> 32:46.280
I'll take you to a hotel for a few days.

437
32:46.720 --> 32:48.240
We can't let anyone see you like this.

438
32:48.280 --> 32:50.440
Oh, so this is your idea of taking responsibility?

439
32:50.440 --> 32:52.080
Can't let anyone see me like this?

440
32:52.720 --> 32:53.360
What do you mean?

441
32:59.000 --> 33:01.080
Can we deal with the immediate problem first?

442
33:01.440 --> 33:02.120
You call P'Phet

443
33:02.120 --> 33:03.840
and tell him we have something urgent in Bangkok.

444
33:03.960 --> 33:05.520
I'll drop you off at your place,

445
33:05.760 --> 33:06.840
and then we're done.

446
33:07.200 --> 33:09.520
Oh, that's a brilliant solution.

447
33:09.560 --> 33:11.480
Fine, I'm calling your brother

448
33:11.480 --> 33:13.440
to tell him his little brother slept with me.

449
33:13.600 --> 33:14.400
How about that?

450
33:14.440 --> 33:16.640
Or should we just get married?

451
33:17.240 --> 33:18.560
Where the hell is my phone?

452
33:19.280 --> 33:21.320
You cannot tell my family.

453
33:21.800 --> 33:22.520
Why?

454
33:22.920 --> 33:23.840
Are you scared?

455
33:25.800 --> 33:26.920
Are you going or not?

456
33:26.960 --> 33:30.040
I'm going... to ask your brother to handle this.

457
33:30.080 --> 33:31.920
If he doesn't, I'll tell your father.

458
33:31.960 --> 33:32.680
Sound good?

459
33:35.600 --> 33:36.400
Go ahead.

460
33:37.880 --> 33:39.200
It would be quite a scandal...

461
33:40.000 --> 33:41.840
if people found out that Mr. Ing, the great CEO,

462
33:42.200 --> 33:43.720
had to bottom for the first time.

463
33:46.440 --> 33:47.640
Oh, I'm so scared.

464
33:48.200 --> 33:49.080
Do you think...

465
33:49.080 --> 33:50.480
I'd be afraid of something like that?

466
33:54.360 --> 33:55.360
Reporters?

467
33:55.960 --> 33:57.280
I have hundreds of connections.

468
33:57.280 --> 33:57.840
Just one call

469
33:57.880 --> 33:58.720
and they'd be here right now.

470
33:58.760 --> 33:59.560
Bring it on.

471
33:59.600 --> 34:00.680
You want to play games with me?

472
34:01.320 --> 34:02.960
Do you really think this can scare me?

473
34:04.960 --> 34:06.240
What exactly do you want?

474
34:06.480 --> 34:07.400
It's simple.

475
34:07.400 --> 34:08.280
Turn around, take your pants off,

476
34:08.320 --> 34:09.440
let me have you, and then we're done.

477
34:11.080 --> 34:11.880
Not a chance.

478
34:18.040 --> 34:18.360
[Mr. Phet]

479
34:18.400 --> 34:20.400
It's your brother. Deal with him.

480
34:25.800 --> 34:27.360
Come on, just own up to it.

481
34:29.159 --> 34:29.960
Take it.

482
34:30.520 --> 34:31.239
What?

483
34:31.960 --> 34:32.840
You took me last night,

484
34:32.840 --> 34:34.080
and now you want me to take this?

485
34:34.199 --> 34:35.199
Are you out of your mind?

486
34:36.480 --> 34:37.560
I thought you said you were a man.

487
34:37.800 --> 34:39.199
Go on, talk to your brother.

488
34:39.960 --> 34:41.040
Yeah, right. You're too scared.

489
34:43.639 --> 34:44.560
Hello, Mr. Phet.

490
34:44.760 --> 34:46.520
Mr. Ing, I heard that

491
34:46.560 --> 34:47.679
you went to the beach yesterday.

492
34:47.719 --> 34:48.600
Did you have a good time?

493
34:48.600 --> 34:49.880
Yes, I did.

494
34:50.199 --> 34:52.280
And to be honest, your brother...

495
34:52.600 --> 34:54.760
was particularly energetic.

496
35:00.160 --> 35:01.680
I was actually just about to call you.

497
35:01.960 --> 35:02.880
What is it?

498
35:11.720 --> 35:12.800
Well, the thing is...

499
35:14.120 --> 35:15.800
there's an urgent matter, Mr. Phet.

500
35:17.920 --> 35:20.120
The office in Bangkok is dealing with a few issues,

501
35:20.160 --> 35:22.000
so Yok and I have to rush back.

502
35:22.040 --> 35:23.920
A lot of people are taking time off.

503
35:23.920 --> 35:25.560
We have to go clear some urgent business.

504
35:25.880 --> 35:27.880
That's quite a coincidence.

505
35:28.240 --> 35:29.920
Yeah, I was surprised myself.

506
35:29.960 --> 35:31.280
It's quite a coincidence.

507
35:33.960 --> 35:35.160
How about this, Mr. Phet?

508
35:35.440 --> 35:37.040
Since Yok needs to help me in Bangkok,

509
35:37.080 --> 35:38.600
I'll send Itt

510
35:38.640 --> 35:40.160
to survey the site with you instead.

511
35:40.200 --> 35:43.240
Think of it as a temporary brother swap.

512
35:43.480 --> 35:45.440
Sure, you can take him.

513
35:45.480 --> 35:45.960
Understood.

514
35:46.240 --> 35:48.800
Well, is there anything you want me to tell Yok?

515
35:48.880 --> 35:50.320
I can pass the message along for you.

516
35:54.080 --> 35:54.800
Okay.

517
35:55.440 --> 35:56.800
Alright, goodbye.

518
36:03.880 --> 36:06.200
Itt, Yok and I are going back to Bangkok first.

519
36:06.240 --> 36:07.200
Something urgent came up.

520
36:07.240 --> 36:09.160
You go survey the site with Mr. Phet

521
36:09.200 --> 36:10.880
and make sure you send all the data to me.

522
36:13.960 --> 36:15.080
Did you tell Itt...

523
36:16.320 --> 36:17.720
anything about what happened between us

524
36:17.760 --> 36:18.680
yesterday?

525
36:19.960 --> 36:21.160
That's what you wanna know now?

526
36:22.560 --> 36:24.040
Get things straight with him.

527
36:24.520 --> 36:26.720
Fine, I'll tell him that

528
36:26.880 --> 36:28.640
we have no feelings for each other

529
36:28.680 --> 36:30.880
and there's nothing going on. Sound good?

530
36:35.160 --> 36:36.160
Put some clothes on.

531
36:36.720 --> 36:37.560
The car is about to leave.

532
36:40.720 --> 36:42.040
What kind of outfit is this?

533
36:42.400 --> 36:43.560
You have zero taste.

534
36:49.720 --> 36:50.960
Grab the underwear while you're at it.

535
36:51.920 --> 36:53.880
Are you expecting me to go without underwear?

536
36:53.920 --> 36:54.720
Are you some kind of pervert?

537
37:15.720 --> 37:16.520
[Egress Window]

538
37:16.520 --> 37:19.280
Dammit, why do we have to take the fire escape?

539
37:19.320 --> 37:21.280
And you went so hard on me last night.

540
37:21.280 --> 37:22.400
How am I supposed to walk down?

541
37:22.680 --> 37:24.000
Taking the elevator is too risky.

542
37:24.000 --> 37:25.000
Risky how?

543
37:25.040 --> 37:26.200
Nobody's gonna notice me in this outfit.

544
37:26.240 --> 37:27.560
No one's going to care.

545
37:28.120 --> 37:30.160
P'Ing, can you just stop complaining?

546
37:31.240 --> 37:32.040
Dammit.

547
37:35.800 --> 37:37.040
How many more floors are there?

548
37:37.120 --> 37:37.920
Let me help.

549
37:37.960 --> 37:38.640
No way.

550
37:38.680 --> 37:41.200
What if you suddenly shove me down the stairs?

551
37:41.320 --> 37:42.320
I don't trust you.

552
37:50.360 --> 37:51.560
Do you like Yok?

553
37:54.600 --> 37:56.800
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

554
37:56.920 --> 37:58.880
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

555
37:59.120 --> 38:01.120
Isn't Yok supposed to be handling this project?

556
38:01.880 --> 38:04.520
Yes, but he's currently on leave.

557
38:05.280 --> 38:06.280
Let go of me.

558
38:07.680 --> 38:08.440
Why?

559
38:08.560 --> 38:10.600
You have no right to touch my mom's shares.

560
38:13.800 --> 38:16.840
Why won't you just give up on this already?
